trong>${state.policies.relief?'Active':'Inactive'}</strong></div><button class="small-action" data-action="policy">Debate policy</button></div></div><div class="panel-card" style="margin-top:14px"><div class="panel-head"><h2>Economic feedback loops</h2><span class="badge ${state.food<30?'rust':''}">${state.food<30?'SHORTAGE WATCH':'MARKET STEADY'}</span></div><p class="inspector-p">${state.weather==='A dry spell'?'Dry weather cuts harvest yields. Lower reserves push prices up, put household budgets under pressure, and can raise migration and political tension.':'Weather changes harvests; harvests and policy shift prices. Prices affect household wealth and work, which in turn influence wellbeing, approval, and future investment.'} Today: grain reserves ${Math.round(state.food)}%, household wealth ${state.wealth}%, public trust ${state.approval}%.</p></div>`}
