TANT TIES</h3>${ties.map(r=>{let other=state.people.find(x=>x.id===(r.a===p.id?r.b:r.a));return`<div class="relationship-card" data-person="${other?.id}"><div class="portrait">${initials(other?.name||'?')}</div><div><strong>${other?.name||'Neighbor'}</strong><small>${r.type} · Trust ${r.trust}%</small></div><span>${r.affection}%</span></div>`}).join('')||'<p class="inspector-p">New friendships will grow through daily life.</p>'}</div><div class="inspector-section"><h3>RECENT MEMORY</h3>${p.memory.slice(0,3).map(m=>`<p class="inspector-p" style="margin:7px 0">· ${m}</p>`).join('')}</div><div class="watch-card"><strong>Meet this person where they are</strong><p>A kind word can change a day. Relationships, memories, and future choices persist.</p><button data-action="interact" data-person="${p.id}">Share a moment ↗</button></div>`}
